{
  "name": "Breath Weapon",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As an Action, your companion can exhale destructive energy in a 30 feet cone. The damage type is that of its Draconic Blood feature. Each creature in the cone must make a Dexterity Saving Throw against your companion's Save DC, which is equal to 8 + your proficiency + its Constitution modifier, taking 8d6 damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.</p><p>Your companion cannot use this feature again until it has finished a Short or Long Rest, or until you expend a use of your Second Wind to allow it use it again (no action required).</p>",
